{"about_the_game":"<strong>Black Myth: Heaven</strong> is a rogue-like action game with Rune-build feature. Based on 4 basic actions: <strong>light attack</strong>, <strong>heavy attack</strong>, <strong>skill</strong> and <strong>dodge </strong>,  you will assign runes in your weapon among slots of these 4 actions to build your battle style.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065920/extras/\u5e7b\u5f71\u7b26\u6587.gif?t=1726210630\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065920/extras/\u71c3\u70e7\u7b26\u6587.gif?t=1726210630\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065920/extras/\u65e5\u6708\u7b26\u6587.gif?t=1726210630\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065920/extras/\u95ea\u7535\u7b26\u6587.gif?t=1726210630\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Slash Into Hell</h2>As the Revenge Agent of Heaven, you will be able to use more than 3 classes, 12 types of weapon to slash among demons.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">4 Chapters, over 20 types of monsters</h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065920/extras/\u672a\u6807\u9898-1.png?t=1726210630\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Growing Power of Weapon</h2>Kill demons to collect gems, and then turn gems into rune inlays for your weapon. The runes could provide various of new abilities to contribute to your battle style.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065920/extras/ezgif-5-1aca06d042.gif?t=1726210630\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Death Is Beginning</h2>If you die in a fight, the weapon is also lost with all the runes inlay. Your can start another challenge and if lucky enough, you could find the lost weapon.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Permanent Upgrade</h2>Win or lose, when you reborn back to heaven, all the gems you collect along the way will turn to dust. Make use of these dust to unlock permanent upgrade.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065920/extras/\u5c40\u5916\u5347\u7ea7.png?t=1726210630\" />","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3065920?t=1726210630","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3065920?t=1726210630","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065920/ad993a2c248ff860ad8b7a5ce35004399aa6bca5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1726210630","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065920/ad993a2c248ff860ad8b7a5ce35004399aa6bca5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1726210630","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<strong>Black Myth: Heaven</strong> is a rogue-like action game with Rune-build feature. Based on 4 basic actions: <strong>light attack</strong>, <strong>heavy attack</strong>, <strong>skill</strong> and <strong>dodge </strong>,  you will assign runes in your weapon among slots of these 4 actions to build your battle style.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065920/extras/\u5e7b\u5f71\u7b26\u6587.gif?t=1726210630\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065920/extras/\u71c3\u70e7\u7b26\u6587.gif?t=1726210630\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065920/extras/\u65e5\u6708\u7b26\u6587.gif?t=1726210630\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065920/extras/\u95ea\u7535\u7b26\u6587.gif?t=1726210630\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Slash Into Hell</h2>As the Revenge Agent of Heaven, you will be able to use more than 3 classes, 12 types of weapon to slash among demons.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">4 Chapters, over 20 types of monsters</h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065920/extras/\u672a\u6807\u9898-1.png?t=1726210630\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Growing Power of Weapon</h2>Kill demons to collect gems, and then turn gems into rune inlays for your weapon. The runes could provide various of new abilities to contribute to your battle style.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065920/extras/ezgif-5-1aca06d042.gif?t=1726210630\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Death Is Beginning</h2>If you die in a fight, the weapon is also lost with all the runes inlay. Your can start another challenge and if lucky enough, you could find the lost weapon.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Permanent Upgrade</h2>Win or lose, when you reborn back to heaven, all the gems you collect along the way will turn to dust. Make use of these dust to unlock permanent upgrade.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065920/extras/\u5c40\u5916\u5347\u7ea7.png?t=1726210630\" />","developers":["ShaneGame"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065920/header.jpg?t=1726210630","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257047387,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257047387/movie480.mp4?t=172